    gui_content_renderer_parser_expected_pattern_found_use_2026-08-12, 1, "2026-11-13: On release/1.0.0 35144b7f5e9, Linux aarch64 seed af717f53d6bce3e5 after 69166cadc70 put a fn between the use lines of gui_content_renderer.spl: test/01_unit/lib/gc_async_mut/ui/gui_content_renderer_spec.spl parses and executes 3 examples with no expected-pattern-found-Use error; test/02_integration/rendering/host_gui_content_frame_spec.spl 1/1. The 2 assertion failures in gui_content_renderer_spec (retained seed returns false on cpu) are a different defect, filed separately."

